### Local smoke tests. Run the API in Development with "Auth": { "DevBypass": true } in appsettings.Development.json.
@host = https://localhost:5001

### Onboarding API: submit an application (multipart: payload JSON + one file per document type)
POST {{host}}/v1/applications
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001
X-Dev-Roles: Loan.Submit
X-Dev-Dealer-Id: D-10442
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="payload"

{"dealerId":"D-10442","requestedAmount":28500,"termMonths":48,"customer":{"firstName":"Asha","lastName":"Rao","email":"asha@example.com","phone":"+919999999999","dateOfBirth":"1990-04-12","nationalId":"ABCDE1234F"}}
--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ID_PROOF"; filename="id.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--BOUNDARY--

### Status API (use the ackId from the response above)
GET {{host}}/v1/applications/REPLACE_ACK_ID/status
X-Dev-Roles: Loan.Read
X-Dev-Dealer-Id: D-10442

### Status API: list a dealer's applications
GET {{host}}/v1/dealers/D-10442/applications?status=VERIFICATION
X-Dev-Roles: Loan.Read
X-Dev-Dealer-Id: D-10442

### Approval API: agent queue
GET {{host}}/v1/approvals/queue
X-Dev-Roles: Loan.Agent
X-Dev-User: agent-1

### Approval API: approve
POST {{host}}/v1/applications/REPLACE_ACK_ID/approve
X-Dev-Roles: Loan.Approver
X-Dev-User: approver-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "consentRef": "REC-2026-000123",
  "scriptVersion": "v3",
  "callReference": "CALL-98765",
  "confirmedAmount": 28500,
  "confirmedTermMonths": 48,
  "disclosuresDelivered": true,
  "comment": "Customer confirmed terms"
}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready
